+the requested Stage 05 task; that file is used as the governing prompt.
+
+Repository instructions and initial state
+-----------------------------------------
+No AGENTS.md exists in this repository.
+
+Initial git status --short:
+?? prompts/05_taylor_infty.md
+
+Initial git log --oneline --decorate -n 15:
+28f8fa4 (HEAD -> master) Remove obsolete stage audit artifacts
+2557db0 Define HeunWI characteristic values and spectral condition
+7145e48 Restore complete physical context in manuscript
